<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f6f8;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        
        .email-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .logo {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .logo-icon {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 28px;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        
        .logo-text {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        
        .email-body {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }
        
        .email-title {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1e293b;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .email-message {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #64748b;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #1d4ed8 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 16px 40px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.39);
        }
        
        .cta-button:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8 0%, #1e40af 100%);
        }
        
        .button-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        
        .token-box {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            border: 2px dashed #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .token-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        
        .token-code {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1e293b;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            word-break: break-all;
        }
        
        .info-box {
            background: #fef3c7;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        
        .info-title {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #92400e;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .info-list {
            list-style: none;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        
        .info-list li {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #78350f;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        
        .info-list li:before {
            content: "\2713";
            color: #f59e0b;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 8px;
        }
        
        .security-box {
            background: #dbeafe;
            border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        
        .security-title {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1e40af;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .security-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #1e3a8a;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        .email-footer {
            background: #f8fafc;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        
        .footer-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .footer-links {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        
        .footer-links a {
            color: #2563eb;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 10px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        .footer-links a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: #e2e8f0;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            body {
                padding: 20px 10px;
            }
            
            .email-header {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
            
            .email-body {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
            
            .email-title {
                font-size: 20px;
            }
            
            .email-message {
                font-size: 14px;
            }
            
            .cta-button {
                padding: 14px 30px;
                font-size: 14px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        {# Header #}
        <div class="email-header">
            <div class="logo">
                <div class="logo-icon">&#128663;</div>
                <div class="logo-text">wazeBR</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {# Body #}
        <div class="email-body">
            <h1 class="email-title">Recupera&ccedil;&atilde;o de Senha</h1>
            
            <p class="email-message">
                Ol&aacute;,<br><br>
                Recebemos uma solicita&ccedil;&atilde;o para redefinir a senha da sua conta wazeBR. 
                Se voc&ecirc; n&atilde;o fez esta solicita&ccedil;&atilde;o, pode ignorar este email com seguran&ccedil;a.
            </p>

            {# CTA Button #}
            <div class="button-container">
                <a href="{{ resetUrl }}" class="cta-button">
                    &#128273; Redefinir Minha Senha
                </a>
            </div>

            {# Or Token #}
            <div class="token-box">
                <div class="token-label">Ou use este c&oacute;digo:</div>
                <div class="token-code">{{ token }}</div>
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            {# Info Box #}
            <div class="info-box">
                <div class="security-title">&#9888; Importante</div>
                <ul class="info-list">
                    <li>Este link &eacute; v&aacute;lido por <strong>1 hora</strong></li>
                    <li>S&oacute; pode ser usado <strong>uma vez</strong></li>
                    <li>N&atilde;o compartilhe este link com ningu&eacute;m</li>
                    <li>Nossa equipe nunca pede sua senha por email</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            {# Security Notice #}
            <div class="security-box">
                <div class="security-title">&#128274; Seguran&ccedil;a</div>
                <p class="security-text">
                    Este &eacute; um email autom&aacute;tico e seguro. O link acima usar&aacute; conex&atilde;o criptografada 
                    (HTTPS) para proteger seus dados. Se voc&ecirc; n&atilde;o solicitou esta redefini&ccedil;&atilde;o, 
                    sua conta est&aacute; segura e nenhuma a&ccedil;&atilde;o &eacute; necess&aacute;ria.
                </p>
            </div>

            <p class="email-message">
                Precisa de ajuda? Entre em contato com nosso suporte em <strong>suporte@wazebr.com</strong>
            </p>
        </div>

        {# Footer #}
        <div class="email-footer">
            <p class="footer-text">
                &copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} wazeBR. Todos os direitos reservados.
            </p>
            <p class="footer-text">
                Desenvolvido com &#10084; no Brasil 🇧🇷
            </p>
            
            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="{{ url('app_home') }}">Home</a>
                <a href="{{ url('app_login') }}">Login</a>
                <a href="#">Suporte</a>
                <a href="#">Privacidade</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
